# GenBanky installation

Install the GenBanky package directly from GitHub using either of these methods:

## Method 1: Using `devtools`

```r
# Install devtools if not already installed
if (!require("devtools")) install.packages("devtools")

# Install GenBanky
devtools::install_github("SergejRuff/GenBanky")
```

## Method 2: Using `remotes`

```r
# Install remotes if not already installed
if (!require("remotes")) install.packages("remotes")

# Install GenBanky
remotes::install_github("SergejRuff/GenBanky")
```

## After Installation

### Example Usage

```r
# Load package
library(GenBanky)

# Read example GenBank file
gb_file <- system.file("extdata", "flavivirus.gb", package = "GenBanky")
gb_data <- read_gbk(gb_file)

# Access features from first sequence
gb_data@sequences[[1]]@FEATURES
```

